    "scienceEn": "Peppermint is a natural hybrid of spearmint and water mint. Its active essential oil consists of 40-50% menthol. Menthol specifically binds to the TRPM8 ion channel in sensory nerve fibers, which normally responds to physical cold temperatures; this tricks the brain into perceiving an icy blast of cooling freshness without temperature change. In Moroccan 'Maghrebi mint tea', fresh spearmint is steeped with gunpowder green tea and cane sugar.",
