    "scienceExplainedEn": "Unlike high-sugar colas or taurine energy drinks, mate soda relies on extract from the South American holly tree Ilex paraguariensis. Mate contains caffeine combined with theobromine and theophylline. This xanthine triad releases into the bloodstream more gradually, preventing the nervous crash associated with coffee while delivering crisp digestive refreshment.",
