    "faqEn": "Why does ground pre-packaged pepper taste dusty? Volatile essential terpene oils evaporate within hours of grinding; pre-ground pepper retains only piperine heat without fragrant complexity.",
    "faqDe": "Warum schmeckt fertig gemahlener Pfeffer aus der Dose staubig? Die fl\u00fcchtigen Aromaterpene verfliegen wenige Stunden nach dem Mahlen; es bleibt nur noch flache Sch\u00e4rfe ohne Aroma.",
    "guestFaqEn": "Why does ground pre-packaged pepper taste dusty? Volatile essential terpene oils evaporate within hours of grinding; pre-ground pepper retains only piperine heat without fragrant complexity.",
