    "scienceEn": "The traditional Viennese Kaisersemmel was created during the reign of Emperor Franz Joseph. The signature five curved folds ('Stern') are formed by folding outer dough flaps inward before baking. Steam injected into the deck oven condenses on the cold dough surface, keeping the skin flexible so the roll expands dramatically, before evaporating to bake into an ultra-thin, crackling crust.",
    "scienceDe": "Das echte Wiener Kaiserbr\u00f6tchen wird traditionell mit f\u00fcnf bogenf\u00f6rmigen Teigfalten von Hand geschlagen ('handsemmelt'). Der B\u00e4ckerdampf im Ofen kondensiert auf der Teighaut, h\u00e4lt sie dehnbar f\u00fcr maximales Ofenvolumen und sorgt f\u00fcr die typisch r\u00f6sche, d\u00fcnne Kruste mit feiner Malznote.",
    "scienceExplainedEn": "The traditional Viennese Kaisersemmel was created during the reign of Emperor Franz Joseph. The signature five curved folds ('Stern') are formed by folding outer dough flaps inward before baking. Steam injected into the deck oven condenses on the cold dough surface, keeping the skin flexible so the roll expands dramatically, before evaporating to bake into an ultra-thin, crackling crust.",
    "scienceExplainedDe": "Das echte Wiener Kaiserbr\u00f6tchen wird traditionell mit f\u00fcnf bogenf\u00f6rmigen Teigfalten von Hand geschlagen ('handsemmelt'). Der B\u00e4ckerdampf im Ofen kondensiert auf der Teighaut, h\u00e4lt sie dehnbar f\u00fcr maximales Ofenvolumen und sorgt f\u00fcr die typisch r\u00f6sche, d\u00fcnne Kruste mit feiner Malznote.",
    "culinaryEn": "Essential staple of hotel breakfast buffets, halved with butter, artisan fruit jams, ham, cold cuts, or soft-boiled eggs.",
    "culinaryDe": "Unverzichtbar am Fr\u00fchst\u00fccksbuffet; klassisch mit Butter, Konfit\u00fcre, Honig, Schinken oder gekochtem Fr\u00fchst\u00fccksei.",
