    "faqEn": "Baked vs. Fried Empanadas? Mendoza/Salta style are oven-baked ('al horno'); coastal and street styles are deep-fried ('fritas').",
    "faqDe": "Gebacken oder frittiert? In den Andenregionen (Salta/Mendoza) werden sie im Ofen gebacken; an der K\u00fcste oft knusprig frittiert.",
    "guestFaqEn": "Baked vs. Fried Empanadas? Mendoza/Salta style are oven-baked ('al horno'); coastal and street styles are deep-fried ('fritas').",
